    "Add validated canonical ProductName and ProductReleaseId, including SemVer-only coordinated-train validation and exact callisto@X.Y.Z tag rendering.",
    "Stage the closed RegistryArtifactPublish, ProductTag, ForgePrepare, ArtifactUpload and ForgePublish identity variants and their package/product ownership rules, preserving RegistryBindingId. Promote them to the sole exported ReleaseOperationId only in PM-004's joint cutover.",
    "Make successor intent validation enforce one product release, one product tag, package registry identity ownership, product operation ownership, duplicate and prerequisite rejection, and canonical operation ordering.",
